    "notes": "Bullish Meeting Lines are approximated by a bullish candle whose low sits at the open and whose body exceeds the documented BodyAveragePeriod 3 average body, confirmed by the documented LongEntryLevel 30; exits use ExitLowerLevel 20 or a bearish candle. StochasticSmoothing 25 and StochasticSignal 36 are dropped, the short side is omitted, and the oscillator denominator can be zero."
